{"synopsis":"Semua yang melawan monster pada akhirnya dipaksa untuk membuat pilihan.\nSalah satu jalan adalah jalan penyihir, yang menggunakan sihir yang mampu menciptakan keajaiban supranatural.\nYang lainnya adalah jalan pendekar pedang, yang menguasai teknik-teknik luar biasa melalui keterampilan murni.\nOscar, seorang pendekar pedang, telah mengayunkan pedang sejak kecil dan naik ke peringkat Pendekar Pedang Tertinggi.\n\nDia menebas monster-monster ganas, mendapatkan kekaguman orang-orang, dan menjalani kehidupan yang diirikan oleh semua orang.\n\nNamun jauh di lubuk hatinya, dia menyimpan kerinduan rahasia—\nkekaguman yang tak terpenuhi terhadap jalan penyihir…?","alternative_title":"回帰した剣聖の魔法理論","author":"TOTSU Akita","artist":"SORAJIMA","chapters":[{"number":"33","chapter":"33","slug":"31bb9d56-f46e-4aa7-ac11-94da97bde93e","date":"2026-07-31","images":[]},{"number":"32","chapter":"32","slug":"ff547427-0cfa-4b0c-aa54-d81c205d513c","date":"2026-07-24","images":[]},{"number":"31","chapter":"31","slug":"76e7768e-1e57-4d30-bb45-47008b9187f6","date":"2026-07-17","images":[]},{"number":"30","chapter":"30","slug":"3d9baba1-476f-4c0b-8f18-2107743373b1","date":"2026-07-10","images":[]},{"number":"29","chapter":"29","slug":"1598803b-f839-426f-9585-672da7ca5423","date":"2026-07-03","images":[]},{"number":"28","chapter":"28","slug":"22561f28-ebfe-4633-908b-dcd811464bd2","date":"2026-06-26","images":[]},{"number":"27","chapter":"27","slug":"a3365933-aa72-4d64-adc9-923bf832e996","date":"2026-06-18","images":[]},{"number":"26","chapter":"26","slug":"031b97e6-d293-4e8a-b7ad-ca0004face24","date":"2026-06-11","images":[]},{"number":"25","chapter":"25","slug":"40491825-93a6-4171-b7fd-9dfa05db3681","date":"2026-06-05","images":[]},{"number":"24","chapter":"24","slug":"d95019a9-a169-43f3-952b-0a8b9cddc76d","date":"2026-05-28","images":[]},{"number":"23","chapter":"23","slug":"02920e90-33ec-46b4-934b-ddbace3cfbaf","date":"2026-05-22","images":[]},{"number":"22","chapter":"22","slu